# Wilt-Leaf Liege: "Other green creatures you control get +1/+1. Other white creatures you control get +1/+1." Bot1 casts Liege
# off Black Lotus and Mox Pearl, with a Llanowar Elves (green only), an Ornithopter (colorless) and, on turn 3, a Savannah Lions
# (white only). The Elves are 2/2 and the Lions 3/2 - each color's bonus alone - while the Ornithopter stays 0/2 and Liege, green
# and white itself, stays 4/4 (the word "other"). Bot2's own Savannah Lions, cast between, stays 2/1 ("you control").

